msgid "RustFS"
msgstr "RustFS"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"

msgid "Updated RustFS settings."
msgstr "已更新 RustFS 設定。"

msgid "RustFS is an S3 compatible object storage server. Select the data shared folder first, then enable the service and click Save and then Apply. Buckets, users and policies are managed in the RustFS console."
msgstr "RustFS 是相容 S3 的物件儲存伺服器。請先選擇資料共享資料夾，然後啟用服務並點擊「儲存」，再點擊「套用」。儲存桶、使用者與原則皆在 RustFS 主控台中管理。"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "狀態"

msgid "Service status"
msgstr "服務狀態"

msgid "Running means the RustFS service is active on this machine."
msgstr "「執行中」表示 RustFS 服務已在本機執行。"

msgid "Bundled version"
msgstr "內建版本"

msgid "The RustFS version that is bundled in this package."
msgstr "本外掛套件內建的 RustFS 版本。"

msgid "Data directory"
msgstr "資料目錄"

msgid "The resolved path of the selected data shared folder."
msgstr "所選資料共享資料夾解析後的實際路徑。"

msgid "Service"
msgstr "服務"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "已啟用"

msgid "Start the RustFS service automatically at boot. A data shared folder must be selected first. Click Save and then Apply to take effect."
msgstr "開機時自動啟動 RustFS 服務。必須先選擇資料共享資料夾。點擊「儲存」，再點擊「套用」後生效。"

msgid "Data shared folder"
msgstr "資料共享資料夾"

msgid "The shared folder that holds the RustFS object data. It must be located on a mounted filesystem. RustFS cannot be started before it is selected."
msgstr "用於存放 RustFS 物件資料的共享資料夾，必須位於已掛載的檔案系統上。在完成選擇之前 RustFS 無法啟動。"

msgid "Network"
msgstr "網路"

msgid "S3 API port"
msgstr "S3 API 連接埠"

msgid "The port the S3 compatible API listens on. The default is 9000."
msgstr "相容 S3 的 API 監聽連接埠，預設為 9000。"

msgid "Console port"
msgstr "主控台連接埠"

msgid "The port of the RustFS web console. The default is 9001. It must differ from the S3 API port."
msgstr "RustFS 網頁主控台連接埠，預設為 9001，且必須與 S3 API 連接埠不同。"

msgid "Enable console"
msgstr "啟用主控台"

msgid "Serve the RustFS web console. Disable it to expose only the S3 API."
msgstr "提供 RustFS 網頁主控台。關閉後僅暴露 S3 API。"

msgid "Credentials"
msgstr "認證資訊"

msgid "Access key"
msgstr "Access Key"

msgid "Used as the user name by every S3 client. It is generated randomly at install time."
msgstr "所有 S3 用戶端用它作為使用者名稱，安裝時隨機產生。"

msgid "Secret key"
msgstr "Secret Key"

msgid "Used as the password by every S3 client. Keep it secret and rotate it with the Regenerate credentials button."
msgstr "所有 S3 用戶端用它作為密碼，請妥善保密。可使用「重新產生認證資訊」按鈕輪替。"

msgid "Logging"
msgstr "日誌"

msgid "Log level"
msgstr "日誌等級"

msgid "Trace"
msgstr "Trace"

msgid "Debug"
msgstr "Debug"

msgid "Info"
msgstr "Info"

msgid "Warning"
msgstr "警告"

msgid "Error"
msgstr "錯誤"

msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "進階"

msgid "Extra environment options"
msgstr "額外環境變數項目"

msgid "Additional lines appended verbatim to the generated environment file. Use only for settings that are not covered by this form. Invalid values prevent RustFS from starting."
msgstr "附加寫入所產生環境檔案的原始行。僅用於本表單未涵蓋的設定，取值不合法會導致 RustFS 無法啟動。"

msgid "Start"
msgstr "開始"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重新啟動"

msgid "RustFS service started."
msgstr "RustFS 服務已啟動。"

msgid "RustFS service stopped."
msgstr "RustFS 服務已停止。"

msgid "Do you really want to restart the RustFS service?"
msgstr "確定要重新啟動 RustFS 服務嗎？"

msgid "RustFS service restarted."
msgstr "RustFS 服務已重新啟動。"

msgid "Regenerate credentials"
msgstr "重新產生認證資訊"

msgid "Do you really want to generate a new access and secret key pair? Every S3 client using the current credentials must be reconfigured."
msgstr "確定要產生新的 Access Key 與 Secret Key 嗎？所有正在使用目前認證資訊的 S3 用戶端都需要重新設定。"

msgid "A new access and secret key pair was generated. Click Apply to deploy it."
msgstr "已產生新的 Access Key 與 Secret Key。點擊「套用」後生效。"

msgid "View logs"
msgstr "檢視日誌"

msgid "RustFS logs"
msgstr "RustFS 日誌"

msgid "View generated config"
msgstr "檢視產生的設定"

msgid "Generated environment file"
msgstr "產生的環境檔案"

msgid "Open console"
msgstr "開啟主控台"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "執行中"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "已停止"
